; PrusaLink gem test file. Safe to print: it never moves, heats, cools or extrudes.
; It only shows messages and waits, for about 3 minutes, so a test can read, pause and stop the job.
; No G0/G1/G28, no tool change, no M104/M109/M140/M190, no fan, no M862 printer check.
